 6+ years of progressive revenue accounting experience, ideally in SaaS, subscription, or marketplace environments;
 Strong technical revenue accounting skills, including deep understanding of IFRS 15 / ASC 606 revenue recognition standards;
 Proficiency in NetSuite ARM (Advanced Revenue Management) system;
 Experience with M&A revenue integration or purchase accounting is a plus;
 Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with a track record of identifying and implementing process improvements;
 Strong attention to detail and accuracy;
